{"id":9270018,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-ras/merge_requests/126","number":126,"state":"open","title":"Fix FP16 subnormal rounding for MatmulAbftVerify mean factor","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-ras/pulls/126","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-ras/pulls/126/issues","body":"# Fix FP16 subnormal rounding for MatmulAbftVerify mean factor\n\n## 描述\n\nFor FP16 inputs and `K=20,000,000`, the tiling factor `1/K` should round to `0x0001`, but the host conversion returns zero. Allow exponent `-25` through the existing round-to-nearest-even conversion and add a tiling regression for `aMeanFactorBits`.\n\n## 测试\n\nAt CANN 9.2.0-beta.2 on `ascend910b`, the baseline host suite reproduced the issue (12/13 passed); the fixed suite passed 13/13 twice. Device-level behavior remains unverified.\n\n## 文档更新\n\nNo documentation change.\n\n## 类型标签\n\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他\n\n关联 Issue: https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-ras/issues/53","assignees_number":0,"assignees":[],"testers":[],"approval_reviewers":[],"labels":[{"id":4929,"color":"#2865E0","name":"cann-cla/yes","repository_id":9173747,"created_at":"2025-06-21T10:53:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-09-28T09:16:09+08:00"},{"id":3873,"color":"#21BA45","name":"ci-pipeline-passed","repository_id":9173747,"created_at":"2025-06-10T14:17:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-10-23T11:27:11+08:00"}],"created_at":"2026-09-28T09:15:59+08:00","updated_at":"2026-10-29T11:51:41+08:00","closed_at":"","merged_at":"","draft":false,"can_merge_check":false,"prune_branch":false,"mergeable":true,"user":{"id":"682829bcddc3c54994a73773","login":"KaranocaVe","name":"KaranocaVe","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fa/bd/7fa9bd496053ea0de5747262539f465fe79c8f4ed62199edbe5721fc0e1f03e0.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/KaranocaVe"},"head":{"ref":"fix/2026-09-27-ops-ras-valid-numeric-execution-bug-hunt-01","sha":"aca186117397ff32b3634fe79987abe29244a28a","label":"fix/2026-09-2